Lab 1: School Search
Team Member: Sage Kaplan

Requirements:
Python 3
No additional packages are required.

Running the Program:
No compilation is required.

Place schoolsearch.py and students.txt in the same directory.

From that directory, run:
python3 schoolsearch.py

The program will display:
Input Command:

Enter search commands at the prompt.
Enter "Q" or "Quit" to terminate the program.

Files:
schoolsearch.py: School search program
students.txt: Student data file
tests.txt: Test suite
tests.out: Output from testing
writeup-lab1.pdf: Lab writeup
README: Instructions for running the program

